Focus charged energy and strike an enemy for [117%, 144%, 166%, 184%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as lightning.

Energy will then discharge from your weapon, doing an extra [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] lightning damage and halving their stun/daze/freeze/pin resistance for [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

If the target is pinned and Charged Shield is sustained, its absorb value will be increased by [181, 244, 293, 334, 371 (TL1-5; MP 100)].

If the target is frozen, the ice will melt in a flash of vapour, knocking back all creatures around it in radius 2.

The discharge damage will scale with your Mindpower.
